ctionary%2F%3Fq%3Doctopus&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AOctopus\" class=\"Z3988\"></span>&#32;<span style=\"font-size:0.95em; font-size:95%; color: var( --color-subtle, #555 )\">(Subscription or <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.oed.com/public/login/loggingin#withyourlibrary\">participating institution membership</a> required.)</span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-NOAD-15\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-NOAD_15-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFStevensonLindberg2010\" class=\"citation book cs1\">Stevenson, Angus; Lindberg, Christine A., eds. (2010). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://books.google.com/books?id=sZoFRwAACAAJ\"><i>New Oxford American Dictionary</i></a> (3rd&#160;ed.). Oxford University Press. <a href=\"/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ISBN (identifier)\">ISBN</a>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0-19-539288-3\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0-19-539288-3\"><bdi>978-0-19-539288-3</bdi></a>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=New+Oxford+American+Dictionary&amp;rft.edition=3rd&amp;rft.pub=Oxford+University+Press&amp;rft.date=2010&amp;rft.isbn=978-0-19-539288-3&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fbooks.google.com%2Fbooks%3Fid%3DsZoFRwAACAAJ&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AOctopus\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>"
